In this update, we've redesigned the User Interface for a more centralized and easy to use view:

The Calendar will no longer automatically open when launching the game;
The Gop Club is easier to find and it will no longer automatically open when opening the game;
The Shop is easier to find and the Outfit Shop can now be found on the Hamburger Menu;
The responsiveness has been updated.


This Governor of Poker 3 update also brings:


Preparations for upcoming Events!
Bug fixes!


Enjoy this new Update!
